      {
        "id": "original",
        "source": "have fn r52_arithmetic_mean(x, y R) R = (x + y) / 2\nhave fn r52_geometric_mean(x, y R: x >= 0, y >= 0) R = sqrt(x * y)\n\nclaim:\n    ? forall x, y R:\n        x >= 0\n        y >= 0\n        =>:\n            r52_geometric_mean(x, y) <= r52_arithmetic_mean(x, y)\n    x * y >= 0\n    sqrt(x * y)^2 = x * y\n    (x + y)^2 - 4 * x * y = (x - y)^2\n    0 <= (x - y)^2\n    0 <= (x + y)^2 - 4 * x * y\n    4 * x * y <= (x + y)^2\n    x * y <= (x + y)^2 / 4\n    ((x + y) / 2)^2 = (x + y)^2 / 4\n    x * y <= ((x + y) / 2)^2\n    0 <= sqrt(x * y)\n    0 <= x + y\n    0 < 2\n    0 <= (x + y) / 2\n    by contra:\n        ? sqrt(x * y) <= (x + y) / 2\n        sqrt(x * y) > (x + y) / 2\n        sqrt(x * y)^2 > ((x + y) / 2)^2\n        impossible x * y <= ((x + y) / 2)^2\n    r52_geometric_mean(x, y) = sqrt(x * y)\n    r52_arithmetic_mean(x, y) = (x + y) / 2\n",
